[{"id":"5b63082","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"b5ddc2f"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"4f913b4"}]},"elements":[{"id":"ba789e8","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"We are here to help.","jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"e8b7d63"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"bd13f1d"}],"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=8e072a8"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"4808b92","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Unfortunately, weather disasters do happen. We want to help you through anything that comes your way. In the event that your organization faces a natural or unexpected disaster, we will offer assistance to get you up and running with our disaster recovery hosting. </p><p>For natural or unexpected disasters where you expect to be back to normal operations within 4 weeks, we will help your organization to get installed on our hosted cloud system at no charge until you are able to resume normal operations.</p><p>You and your team would gain access to the most recent versions of MIP Accounting, Fundraising 50 and/or Millennium software. If you have a disaster, by using this system, your users will be able to work remotely until your normal operations resume.</p>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"024","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"28963c2"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"c5ae774"}],"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=c0a7353"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"8e6f373","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Actions you need to take when disaster strikes:","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"40","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_element_width":"initial","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"px","size":570,"sizes":[]},"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"e8b7d63"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"bd13f1d"}],"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=8e072a8"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"c381194","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<ul><li><strong>Fill out the “Request Hosting” form below</strong> to let us know you have an emergency. (All customers are automatically eligible for this service; there is no need to pre-register.) </li><li><strong>Provide us with a backup</strong> of your current MIP Accounting or Fundraising 50 database for us to load into the system.</li><li><strong>Obtain access </strong>to a PC with Windows 7 SP1 Professional edition or greater, Windows 8.1 Standard edition or greater, or Windows 10 Standard edition or greater. </li><li><strong>Provide us with a list of users</strong> who need access remotely.</li></ul>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"024","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"28963c2"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"c5ae774"}],"custom_css":"selector strong {
    font-weight: 600;
}","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=c0a7353"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"884dbe4","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"For shutdowns in your local area:","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"40","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_element_width":"initial","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"px","size":570,"sizes":[]},"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"e8b7d63"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"bd13f1d"}],"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=8e072a8"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"02933aa","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"If you expect downtime for greater than 4 weeks, we can still help your organization move to our cloud environment. It will require an adjustment to your current agreement with Momentive Software, but it only takes a few easy steps. Please <strong><a href="https://share.hsforms.com/1d_pSQU13TtOSx6Ym5X5GqA4l3c" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">click here and fill in the form</span></a></strong> and your Customer Account Manager or Consultant will contact you within 24 hours.

It is our hope that you never need us to provide this service, but in the event that you do, we are here to help. If you need technical support for your product, please log a case from the <a href="https://cbk12.force.com/communitybrands/s/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Support Cente</strong><strong>r</strong></span></a>.

You can also contact us directly at <a href="tel:800-945-3278" style="color:#222"><strong>800-945-3278</strong></a>.","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"024","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"28963c2"}],"d500d_dr_conditions":[{"d500d_dr_condition":"breakpoint-mobile","_id":"c5ae774"}],"custom_css":"selector strong {
    font-weight: 600;
}","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=c0a7353"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]

